      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "sigh",
    "position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_amazed-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "私が君に惚れるようなエピソードが、これまでに何かあったかね。私は物語を読み飛ばすことはしないから、それはたぶん落丁だね？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "冗談だよ冗談、というか実験というかね……。説明するから、そこに座りたまえ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/ashamed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "trouble",
    "position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "うむ、よろしい。何だい、顔を赤くして……。初心だねぇ、私まで照れくさくなってしまうじゃないか。すまないね、先ほどは妙なことを言ってしまって"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/habit-7.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "生の反応を見たかったから、詳しく説明せずに呼びだしてしまった。そこは詫びよう、ごめんごめん"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "君ももうすこし用心深く、相手の思惑を推測する癖をつけたほうがいいよ。良いように扱われてしまうからね、馬鹿正直は字面が示すとおりに馬鹿の亜種なのだよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "ふむ。これまで紡いできた、私と君の物語を反芻してみよう。うん、私と君を結んでいるのは……。『図書室』と、『足長おじさん』だね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/serious",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "休館日だと最初に言ったね、あれが伏線だ。今日は、本の貸し出しはできない。ご覧のとおり書架の整理などの図書委員の業務も、すでに完了している"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_question-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "ならば、『足長おじさん』が正解だね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "ありえない可能性をすべて潰して、最後に残ったものが真相になる"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "dumbfounded",
    "position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "うん。君は何だか物覚えが悪そうなので、説明しておこう。私は文芸部の藍乃あいかくんと、文通みたいなことをしている。『足長おじさん』と、名乗ってね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "君も概要はご存知だろうから、詳細な説明は省くけどね。"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/angry1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "シリーズものの第二巻以降に親切のつもりで差しこまれた、『これまでのあらすじ』的なものは鼻につくのだよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_angry-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "こっちは、早く物語のつづきを読みたいのに……。あらすじが知りたければ、既刊を読み返すとも。余分にページを浪費しないでほしい、馬鹿にしないでもらいたいね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "ともあれ。あいかくんは文芸部員として、たまに小説を綴っている。作風は端的に言って、メルヘン＆ロマンスだ。あまり、決めつけたくはないがね"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "そして『足長おじさん』は、あいかくんの悩み相談にのってあげることがおおい。彼女が創作に行き詰まり、小説について助言を請うてくるのも当然の成り行きだね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "彼女はまだ、恋をしたことがないらしい。なのに、ロマンスを書きたがる。ここまで言えば、わかるかね？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
